<div class="container-fluid">
    <h1>Honolulu – Ballot Types</h1>

     
        <div class="bg-light rounded-5 p-3 p-md-4 mb-5">
            <p>
            The URL Checker utilizes AJAX, which occasionally receives a <strong>Too Many Requests (HTTP Code 429)</strong> response. When a link encounters a <strong>HTTP 429</strong> response, it will display the <span class="text-dark dashicons dashicons-update" style="font-size: 24px;"></span> &nbsp;icon (See Legend below for more details). To retry checking the failed links, you can use the <strong>Retry Failed Links Check</strong> button. This process may need to be repeated several times until all links are successfully checked. 
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Note:</strong><br/>
                <em>You can also click on the icon/link and it should take you to the Sample Ballot PDF</em>
            </p>

            <p class="h3 mt-3">Legend:</p>

            <div class="md-12 mb-2">
                <span class="text-success dashicons dashicons-yes-alt me-2" style="font-size: 24px;"></span> – Link exists
            </div>
            <div class="md-12 mb-2">
                <span class="text-danger dashicons dashicons-dismiss me-2" style="font-size: 24px;"></span> – Link does not exist
            </div>
            <div class="md-12 mb-2">
                <span class="text-dark dashicons dashicons-update me-2" style="font-size: 24px;"></span> – Too Many Requests. Use <strong>Retry Failed Links Check</strong> button to recheck
            </div>
            <div class="md-12 mb-4">
                <span class="text-warning dashicons dashicons-buddicons-activity me-2" style="font-size: 24px;"></span> – There is a request error (HTTP Code other than 429 and 200)
            </div>
            <div>
                <button id="check-links-button" class="btn btn-primary me-md-3 mb-3 mb-md-0">Check ALL PDF Links</button>
                <button id="retry-failed-button" class="btn btn-primary">Retry Failed Links Check</button>
            </div>
        </div>
